%9Setting:%9

    show_names_on_join (boolean; default: ON)

%9Description:%9

    Prints the nick list of a channel when you join it.

    The list is a count line ("Total of N nicks ...") and, below it, the
    table of nicks. show_names_on_join_limit and show_names_on_join_alone
    choose when only the count line is printed. Channels that come back
    after /UPGRADE print nothing.

    With the setting OFF a join prints no list; /NAMES still prints it.

%9Examples:%9

    /SET show_names_on_join on
    /SET show_names_on_join off

%9See also:%9

    SET, NAMES, SHOW_NAMES_ON_JOIN_LIMIT, SHOW_NAMES_ON_JOIN_ALONE
